profile: runtime-mirust.retired-workspace-guidance.v1
updated_utc: 2026-09-23T04:27:04Z

guidance:
  Treat this repository as redirect-only.
  Do not rebuild Runtime.MiRust.com as an independent documentation site.
  Put current TinyRustLM developer documentation in E:\Source\Rust\TinyRustLM.MiRust.com.
  Put current browser-local app work only in E:\Source\Rust\TinyRustLM.com.
  Keep source history in Git and current model payloads only in D:\LLMs\TinyRustLM; leave X:\LLMS untouched.

deployment:
  Upload this package only to a verified runtime.mirust.com web root.
  The FileZilla entry currently named Runtime.MiRust.com points to TinyRustLM.MiRust.com and is unsafe for Runtime deployment.
